 "content": "# Edge continuation\n\nUse this branch when demonstrations show color 1 marking an absent continuation at a grid edge. Compare repeated rows, bands, or motif copies to infer the expected continuation and affected cells; it may be a solid suffix or only selected motif-phase positions. Color only confirmed missing continuation cells and preserve the existing motif and unrelated cells. Select repeated copies from demonstration evidence, not from rightmost zeros or suffix length alone.\n"
